  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61949,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 63,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "<p><em>Essential:</em> biphasic tumour composed of benign or atypical M&uuml;llerian epithelium and a malignant (typically low-grade) stromal component.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-06T16:34:00"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61950,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 63,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "<p>This entity is staged according to the Union for International Cancer Control (UICC) TNM classification (see <em>TNM staging of ovarian, fallopian tube, and primary peritoneal carcinoma</em>&nbsp;[[Brierley JD, Gospodarowicz MK, Wittekind C, editors. TNM classification of malignant tumours. 8th ed. Oxford (UK): Wiley-Blackwell; 2017.]]) and the FIGO staging system.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-15T11:12:56"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 61951,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 63,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "<p>The 5-year overall survival rate is about 65%, indicative of more-aggressive behaviour than seen with uterine adenosarcomas; ovarian adenosarcomas often rupture or show surface involvement. The presence of sarcomatous overgrowth or high-grade stroma is also associated with a worse prognosis {12360039}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-23T15:44:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]